---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="没找到这一页" description="页面不存在" noindex>
  <section class="wrap nf">
    <img src="/img/themes/heritage-640.webp" alt="" width="640" height="427" />
    <h1>这条路好像走不通</h1>
    <p>页面可能搬家了，或者链接打错了。</p>
    <div class="nf-a"><a class="btn primary" href="/">回首页</a><button class="btn" type="button" data-open-search>搜一搜</button></div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .nf { text-align: center; padding: 60px 0; display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .nf img { width: min(420px, 90%); border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: var(--sh-2); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .nf h1 { font-size: 32px; }
  .nf p { color: var(--mut); }
  .nf-a { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 8px; }
</style>
